          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ukumbi wa sabato walioujenga katika hiyo nyumba, na mahali pa kuingia pake mfalme palipokuwapo nje, akavigeuza kuikabili nyumba ya BWANA, kwa sababu ya mfalme wa Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
